{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ferreteria Multi-Tienda — Happy Path",
    "description": "Peticiones de camino feliz para el POC (inventario compartido + recomendador híbrido).\n\nPrerrequisitos:\n1. Servidor corriendo: uv run uvicorn backend.app.main:app --reload  (puerto 8000)\n2. Datos cargados. Opciones:\n   a) Seed CLI (directo a SQLite): uv run python -m backend.app.scripts.seed\n   b) Vía endpoints de negocio: uv run python -m backend.app.scripts.import_data\n\nNotas de uso:\n- Ejecuta la colección en orden (Run Collection): el flujo crea un producto demo (SKU099) y una regla, y al final los elimina.\n- {{storeId}} y {{storeMx}} se capturan automáticamente de GET /api/stores (funciona aunque los IDs no empiecen en 1).\n- Cada request incluye una aserción de status code para ver PASS/FAIL en el Collection Runner.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "storeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "storeMx", "value": "" },
    { "key": "demoSku", "value": "SKU099" },
    { "key": "ruleId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('status ok', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "health"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar tiendas (captura storeId y storeMx)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const stores = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('hay tiendas', () => pm.expect(stores.length).to.be.greaterThan(0));",
                  "if (stores.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('storeId', stores[0].id);",
                  "    const merida = stores.find(s => s.nombre === 'Mérida');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('storeMx', merida ? merida.id : stores[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/stores", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "stores"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Catálogo (CRUD)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar productos (28)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "products"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver producto SKU001",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/SKU001",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", "SKU001"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear producto demo (SKU099)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "products"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sku\": \"{{demoSku}}\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Martillo demo\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Producto de prueba para el happy path\",\n  \"categoria\": \"herramienta\",\n  \"material\": \"acero\",\n  \"uso_recomendado\": \"general\",\n  \"precio\": 150,\n  \"stock\": 25\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar precio del demo (PATCH)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{demoSku}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", "{{demoSku}}"]
            },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"precio\": 160\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar producto demo (DELETE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{demoSku}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", "{{demoSku}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Ventas y compras",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Historial de ventas de la tienda",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
